# machine translation from Hungarian, not reviewed yet
#: ../src/main.cpp
msgid "A new color picking feature has been added, and on purpose it is not bound to any key.\\nIt lets you pick the color for the selected lines from the video at the mouse position with a single keypress.\\n\\nPressed twice quickly it magnifies that part of the video around the pointer, and lets you write the color in the dynamic \\t(<current millisecond>,<current millisecond>,\\c...) form as well.\\n\\nFrom that magnified view you can also read the color along a Mocha motion track held on the clipboard, which writes the color the tracked point passes over as a sequence of \\t() tags.\\n\\nTo use it, assign the \"video/colorpick/primary|outline|shadow\" commands to hotkeys (one key each is recommended)."
msgstr "Kolore-hautatzailearen funtzio berri bat gehitu da, nahita ez zaio automatikoki inongo botoiri esleitu.\\nHaren bidez, hautatutako lerroen kolorea bideotik zuzenean saguaren posiziotik lor dezakezu, botoi bat behin sakatuta.\\n\\nBi aldiz azkar sakatuz gero, saguaren inguruko bideo-zatia handituko du eta kolorea dinamikoki \\t(<aktuális milisecond>,<aktuális milisecond>,\\c...) formatuan ere txerta dezakezu.\\n\\nHanditutako ikuspegitik, arbelean dagoen mocha motion track-aren ibilbidean zehar ere irakur dezakezu kolorea: kasu horretan, programak jarraipen-puntuaren azpiko kolorea \\t() tag-en sekuentzia gisa txertatuko du.\\n\\nErabiltzeko, esleitu \"video/colorpick/primary|outline|shadow\" command-a laster-teklei (botoi bakar bati esleitzea gomendatzen da)."

